# the drag that follows extends it to col 11, the end of "world".
#
# x=78, not the old 112: the lean tier renders through vyto/surface/ttf now,
# which is proportional, so "hello world" measures 70px rather than 11*9=99.
# The hit test snaps to the nearest column boundary, so the drag has to land
# PAST 70 to include the final "d" — 78 is the first value that does.
# Keeping 112 would land inside "foo" and quietly change what this asserts.
move 78 30
up 78 30
# the floating toolbar is open: its Copy button sits at ~(50,37)
click 50 37
# a drag with NO long-press must scroll instead of selecting
down 30 30
move 30 5
up 30 5
close
